 data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> (ambient formal setting)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\\in V\">\\(\\kappa\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\\)</span> (cardinal predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"58-df-cardinal\">58-df-cardinal</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcCardinal8SingularStrongLimitCardinal}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcCardinal8SingularStrongLimitCardinal}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcCardinal8StrongLimitCardinal}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcCardinal8StrongLimitCardinal}_S\\)</span> (strong-limit cardinal predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"a285ddc9423fd5f8\" href=\"?note=a285ddc9423fd5f8\" title=\"58-df-zfc-strong-limit-cardinal\">58-df-zfc-strong-limit-cardinal</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{cf}\">\\(\\operatorname{cf}\\)</span> (cofinality function, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"315ad00b8744fdfc\" href=\"?note=315ad00b8744fdfc\" title=\"58-df-cofinality\">58-df-cofinality</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}cardinal8\\text{-}singular\\text{-}strong\\text{-}limit\\text{-}cardinal} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcCardinal8SingularStrongLimitCardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land \\mathrm{ZfcCardinal8StrongLimitCardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\operatorname{cf}(\\kappa)&lt;\\kappa\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}cardinal8\\text{-}singular\\text{-}strong\\text{-}limit\\text{-}cardinal} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcCardinal8SingularStrongLimitCardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land \\mathrm{ZfcCardinal8StrongLimitCardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\operatorname{cf}(\\kappa)&lt;\\kappa\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>This is precisely a strong-limit cardinal whose cofinality is strictly smaller than itself; the source of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{cf}\">\\(\\operatorname{cf}\\)</span> is now explicit.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-cardinal","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-cardinal]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-cofinality","status":"resolved","id":"315ad00b8744fdfc","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-cofinality]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-strong-limit-cardinal","status":"resolved","id":"a285ddc9423fd5f8","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-strong-limit-cardinal]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-cardinal","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S$ (cardinal predicate, see [[58-df-cardinal]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-strong-limit-cardinal","status":"resolved","id":"a285ddc9423fd5f8","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcCardinal8StrongLimitCardinal}_S$ (strong-limit cardinal predicate, see [[58-df-zfc-stro